        "faq-1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is the FeliSpace Cave suitable for all cats?",
            "answer": "Yes! The 50x50x20cm size fits most cats up to 7 kg, and the 60x60x28cm is ideal for big cats or multi-cat homes where two cats share it — one napping on top while the other hides in the tunnel. If you're between sizes, go bigger: cats love having room to stretch and curl up."
          }
        },
        "faq-2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is it made of?",
            "answer": "Thick, high-density felt — soft, warm and naturally scratch-resistant, with no harmful chemicals. The dense felt holds its shape over time, muffles outside noise for a calmer space, and feels cosy enough that your cat will want to settle right in."
          }
        },
        "faq-3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I clean it?",
            "answer": "Super easy. For everyday care, just run a vacuum over it to lift hair and dust. For the odd stain, hand-wash the spot in cold water and let it air-dry flat. Thanks to the zip, the tunnel opens up completely, so cleaning every corner takes seconds."
          }
        },
        "faq-4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will my cat actually use it?",
            "answer": "Almost certainly. The enclosed tunnel shape taps straight into your cat's natural instinct to hide and feel safe. If yours is shy at first, pop their favourite blanket or a treat inside — within a day or two, most cats claim it as their favourite spot. That's exactly why we back it with our guarantee: if your cat doesn't adopt it, you're refunded."
          }
        },
        "faq-5": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does it work as a scratcher too?",
            "answer": "Absolutely. The thick felt surface is perfect for scratching, so your cat naturally targets the Cave instead of your sofa, curtains or carpet. It's a bed, a tunnel and a scratcher in one — one purchase that saves your furniture."
          }
        },
        "faq-6": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What do I get with my order?",
            "answer": "Every FeliSpace Cave comes with free bonuses: a free self-cleaning cat grooming brush (one-click hair removal), a free ebook on reducing anxiety in cats, and free shipping — all included at no extra cost. Want one for each of your cats? Add a 2nd Cave at 50% off at checkout."
          }
        },
        "faq-7": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What are the delivery times?",
            "answer": "Shipping is completely free. Your order arrives in 3–7 working days, and you'll get a tracking email the moment it ships so you can follow it all the way to your door."
          }
        },
        "faq-8": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What's your guarantee?",
            "answer": "You're covered by our 30-day money-back guarantee. If your cat doesn't love their new den — or you're not happy for any reason — just reach out within 30 days for a full refund. No stress, no risk."
          }
        }
